Option Strict On

' <summary>
' Strings of the "Media Exchange Server" group of the manager settings and its tray item
' (tickets 142, 143, 144; ProductNames.ExchangeServer).
'
' The product NAME is never in this table: a sentence that mentions it takes a {0} placeholder
' filled from ProductNames.ExchangeServer, so it stays Latin in all 13 languages. What translates is
' the role description - the exchange server (ru: сервер обмена) - and the words around it. House
' style: ".." for an ellipsis, a plain hyphen, ё in Russian.
'
' Columns after the Russian key: en, uk, de, it, es, fr, pt, ar, hi, bn, ur, zh.
' Никогда не ставьте «умные» кавычки в литерал - VB считает U+201C/U+201D разделителями
' строки; используются «…» и 「…」.
' </summary>
Partial Public NotInheritable Class Localization
